#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended hypervisors for testing Ditana, and how they interact with modern Wayland compositors."
msgstr "Hypervisors recumandads per testar Ditana, e co ch’els interageschan cun compositors Wayland moderns."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Virtual machines"
msgstr "Maschinas virtualas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"If you want to install and test Ditana inside a virtual machine, your choice "
"of virtualization software will heavily influence your experience."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus vulais installar e testar Ditana en ina maschina virtuala, "
"influenzescha Vossa tscherna da la software per maschinas virtualas "
"fermamain Vossa experientscha."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"Ditana ships with four modern desktop environments (XFCE, Wayfire, Niri, and "
"COSMIC). Wayland compositors like Wayfire, Niri, and COSMIC are built around "
"modern 3D hardware acceleration. Consequently, they require a virtual "
"machine capable of passing 3D graphics instructions through to your host "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Ditana furnescha quatter sistems da desktop moderns (XFCE, Wayfire, Niri e "
"COSMIC). Compositors Wayland sco Wayfire, Niri e COSMIC èn concepids per "
"l’acceleraziun 3D moderna cun agid da la hardware. Perquai dovran els ina "
"maschina virtuala che po transmetter las instrucziuns da grafica 3D a Voss "
"sistem host."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended: QEMU / KVM / UTM"
msgstr "Recumandà: QEMU / KVM / UTM"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"Hypervisors based on **KVM** (Linux) or Apple's Hypervisor framework (macOS) "
"expose a modern, highly capable virtual graphics card known as `virtio-gpu`."
msgstr ""
"Hypervisors sin basa da **KVM** (Linux) u dal Hypervisor framework dad Apple "
"(macOS) mettan a disposiziun ina carta da grafica virtuala moderna e da "
"gronda prestaziun, enconuschenta sco `virtio-gpu`."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"**Examples:** GNOME Boxes, virt-manager (Linux), UTM on an Intel Mac. On "
"Apple Silicon, UTM can accelerate only an ARM64 guest, and Ditana publishes "
"an x86_64 image; it runs there under emulation, without a path to the host "
"GPU."
msgstr ""
"**Exempels:** GNOME Boxes, virt-manager (Linux), UTM sin in Mac cun Intel. "
"Sin Apple Silicon po UTM accelerar mo in sistem giast ARM64, e Ditana "
"publitgescha in maletg x86_64; quel funcziuna là en emulaziun, senza via fin "
"tar la GPU dal host."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid "**Support:** **Full.**"
msgstr "**Sustegn:** **Cumplet.**"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"**What works:** XFCE, Wayfire and Niri are available and operate seamlessly, "
"provided you enable 3D acceleration (`virgl` or `Venus`) in your VM's "
"display settings. COSMIC also functions, but via software rendering: it is "
"pinned to `llvmpipe` in every virtual machine, deliberately, to avoid "
"glitches in its GPU backend. Undo that by removing the exports from its "
"login commands if your setup can drive it."
msgstr ""
"**Tge che funcziuna:** XFCE, Wayfire e Niri èn disponibels e funcziunan "
"senza problems, sche Vus activais l’acceleraziun 3D (`virgl` u `Venus`) en "
"ils parameters da visualisaziun da Vossa VM. Er COSMIC funcziuna, dentant "
"cun rendering da software: el è fixà intenziunadamain sin `llvmpipe` en "
"mintga maschina virtuala, per evitar disturbis en ses backend da GPU. "
"Revocai quai cun allontanar ils exports da ses cumonds d’annunzia, sche "
"Vossa configuraziun è abla da far funcziunar quel."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not recommended: VirtualBox & VMware"
msgstr "Betg recumandà: VirtualBox & VMware"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"VirtualBox and VMware rely on older, legacy-style virtual graphics drivers "
"(`vmwgfx`). While they offer a \"3D Acceleration\" checkbox in their "
"settings, their architecture lacks the modern Linux graphics stack features "
"(like full GBM support) required by demanding Wayland compositors."
msgstr ""
"VirtualBox e VMware sa basan sin drivers da grafica virtuals pli vegls e "
"d’in stil antiquà (`vmwgfx`). Els porschan bain ina chaschetta da controlla "
"«3D Acceleration» en lur parameters, ma a lur architectura mancan las "
"funcziuns modernas dal stack da grafica da Linux (sco il sustegn cumplet da "
"GBM) che compositors Wayland pretensius dovran."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid "**Support:** **Fallback mode.**"
msgstr "**Sustegn:** **Modus da reserva.**"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"**What happens:** Ditana checks which DRM driver the kernel has actually "
"bound to the render node. `vmwgfx` and the other drivers these hypervisors "
"present are not Wayland-capable, so Wayfire receives a CPU-rendering "
"fallback – a check that keys on the driver rather than on the hypervisor, "
"and therefore also applies on bare metal with an unlisted driver. COSMIC is "
"pinned to software rendering in every virtual machine, regardless of the "
"driver."
msgstr ""
"**Tge che capita:** Ditana controllescha tge driver DRM ch’il kernel ha "
"effectivamain collià cun il render node. `vmwgfx` ed ils auters drivers che "
"quests hypervisors mettan a disposiziun na sustegnan betg Wayland, uschia "
"che Wayfire survegn ina soluziun da reserva cun rendering tras la CPU – ina "
"controlla che sa basa sin il driver e betg sin il hypervisor e che vala "
"perquai er sin maschinas fisicas cun in driver che manca en la glista. "
"COSMIC è fixà sin rendering da software en mintga maschina virtuala, "
"independentamain dal driver."

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"**Limitations:** Animations may be less smooth, as your CPU is doing the "
"work of a graphics card. Furthermore, the **Niri desktop environment will be "
"hidden** from the installer, as it strictly refuses to launch without proper "
"native 3D hardware."
msgstr ""
"**Restricziuns:** Las animaziuns pon esser main fluidas, perquai che Vossa "
"CPU fa la lavur d’ina carta da grafica. Ultra da quai **zuppa l’installatur "
"il sistem da desktop Niri**, perquai ch’el refusa categoricamain da s’aviar "
"senza ina vaira hardware 3D nativa."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"If you must use VirtualBox or VMware, the traditional **XFCE (X11)** desktop "
"environment remains a very fast and reliable choice."
msgstr ""
"Sche Vus stuais utilisar VirtualBox u VMware, resta il sistem da desktop "
"tradiziunal **XFCE (X11)** ina tscherna fitg svelta e fidaivla."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "*(For technical details on how the installer identifies your hardware and decides what to install, see [Hardware detection](/under-the-hood/hardware-detection/)).*\n"
msgstr "*(Per detagls tecnics davart co che l’installatur identifitgescha Vossa hardware e decida tge che vegn installà, consultai [Identificaziun da la hardware](/under-the-hood/hardware-detection/)).*\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What else changes in a virtual machine"
msgstr "Tge che sa mida anc en ina maschina virtuala"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/best-practices/virtual-machines.md
msgid ""
"Ditana has one more point to say in a virtual machine, and it is not only "
"about Niri. The same check that hides Niri also removes Ghostty from the "
"terminal emulator list, because Ghostty needs OpenGL 4.3; kitty stays, "
"needing only 3.3. In a VirtualBox guest the Guest Additions are offered "
"under Hardware Support Options, which is what brings the shared clipboard "
"and the automatic window resizing."
msgstr ""
"En ina maschina virtuala ha Ditana anc insatge da dir, e quai na pertutga "
"betg mo Niri. La medema controlla che zuppa Niri allontanescha er Ghostty da "
"la glista dals emulaturs da terminal, perquai che Ghostty dovra OpenGL 4.3; "
"kitty resta, perquai ch’el dovra mo 3.3. En in sistem giast da VirtualBox "
"vegnan las Guest Additions purschidas sut Hardware Support Options; quellas "
"porschan l’archiv provisoric cuminaivel e l’adattaziun automatica da la "
"grondezza da la fanestra."
